WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:04.540 --> 00:00:05.540
Hello!

00:00:05.540 --> 00:00:06.890
I'm so glad you could make it tonight.

00:00:06.890 --> 00:00:07.890
Come on in.

00:00:07.890 --> 00:00:09.450
I'll give you the grand tour.

00:00:09.450 --> 00:00:18.520
Now we have three new flavors for everyone
to try.

00:00:18.520 --> 00:00:23.310
All in.

00:00:23.310 --> 00:00:24.869
Having a good evening gentlemen?

00:00:24.869 --> 00:00:28.570
You know, my throat's a little dry...

00:00:28.570 --> 00:00:34.840
Have another drink.

00:00:34.840 --> 00:00:40.900
Attending tonight means joining our society
and allows you to do whatever you please.

00:00:40.900 --> 00:00:49.110
Oh my gosh, I want to drink to that.

00:00:49.110 --> 00:00:50.110
Cheers.

00:00:50.110 --> 00:00:55.590
Where did that red come from?

00:00:55.590 --> 00:00:56.630
Oh.

00:00:56.630 --> 00:00:57.660
Uhhh...

00:00:57.660 --> 00:01:00.760
I don't know.

00:01:00.760 --> 00:01:04.059
Clorux ages their bleach for the strongest
potency.

00:01:04.059 --> 00:01:09.560
So drink up.

00:01:09.560 --> 00:01:16.711
So, what does our top bleach critic have to
say?

00:01:16.711 --> 00:01:27.690
I'm getting a... fresh melon flavor.

00:01:27.690 --> 00:01:32.450
And a hint of honey too.

00:01:32.450 --> 00:01:33.450
Fascinating.

00:01:33.450 --> 00:01:38.659
Again, it is my honor to welcome you to our
exclusive society.

00:01:38.659 --> 00:01:42.979
Sit back, relax, and drink to your heart's
content.

00:01:42.979 --> 00:01:54.210
You'll forget all your worries and the night
will be over before you know it...

00:01:54.210 --> 00:01:57.270
Thanks for joining us for this cleansing affair.

00:01:57.270 --> 00:02:02.000
My name's Cynder and you've probably heard
me on Al Dente Creepypasta before.

00:02:02.000 --> 00:02:04.700
No poisons used there...

00:02:04.700 --> 00:02:06.390
yet.

00:02:06.390 --> 00:02:08.019
You can find those by clicking here.

00:02:08.019 --> 00:02:13.510
I'm a new writer, producer or whatever on
the channel until CZ dies.

00:02:13.510 --> 00:02:14.689
Or vanishes.

00:02:14.689 --> 00:02:17.040
CZ: Ok, I'm back.

00:02:17.040 --> 00:02:18.209
Cynder: Already?

00:02:18.209 --> 00:02:19.389
CZ: Yeah.

00:02:19.389 --> 00:02:21.739
Cynder: Have a drink.

00:02:21.739 --> 00:02:22.919
CZ: Thanks.

00:02:22.919 --> 00:02:25.819
HIt like if you would enjoy an ice cold bleach.

00:02:25.819 --> 00:02:31.989
Remember to subscribe to CZsWorld for horrors
every week, ring the death-bell for notifications

00:02:31.989 --> 00:02:34.430
and I'll see you in the next one.

00:02:34.430 --> 00:02:39.000
Assuming we both survive.

